# Quick manual checks (Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
# Swagger UI: https://localhost:7165/swagger
@api = https://localhost:7165

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### Public — projects (Arabic)
GET {{api}}/api/projects?lang=ar&page=1&pageSize=10

### Public — featured projects (English)
GET {{api}}/api/projects?lang=en&featured=true

### Public — articles search
GET {{api}}/api/articles?lang=en&search=redis

### Public — contact form
POST {{api}}/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "مروان",
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "phone": "0791234567",
  "serviceType": "WebDevelopment",
  "details": "أحتاج موقعاً تعريفياً لشركتي الصغيرة",
  "language": "Ar",
  "website": ""
}

### Login (sets the mqt_refresh cookie; copy accessToken below)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "your-admin-password"
}

### Admin — dashboard
GET {{api}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Admin — create a draft project
POST {{api}}/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titleAr": "نظام حجز القاعات",
  "titleEn": "Hall Booking System",
  "summaryAr": "نظام لإدارة حجوزات القاعات",
  "summaryEn": "A system for managing hall bookings",
  "descriptionAr": "## نظرة عامة",
  "descriptionEn": "## Overview",
  "isReal": true,
  "displayOrder": 0
}
